TrackMe 1.8.7 — notifications worth keeping on.

• A new Activity bulletin collects everything the app has to say, in one place you read when you choose.
• The app now interrupts you at most once a week, across every source combined.
• New: a weekly recap, a sunset warning before you set off, and a check if a ride is still recording after you have stopped moving.
• Set your own weekly reminder. Off unless you turn it on.
• Pick TrackMe's language from Android settings.
